<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST17"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, May 20, 2004 - 6:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Since he&#39;s the odds-on favorite among suspects &#40;not that I think he&#39;s BTK&#41;, we may as well give Mr. Butterworth his own thread.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
