<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST273"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sandy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sandy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, June 13, 2004 - 9:00 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yes Jenkins Butterworth did live in Calif.  BTK told one of his &#34;victims&#34; that he came from Calif. What is so funny about that fact? If you know for sure who the Zodiac is, please tell us !LOL!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
