<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST290"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jenkins<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jenkins<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, June 14, 2004 - 12:06 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t know jack sandy! lol! <BR> <BR> <BR>But that would be WILD if BB was BTK and the Z! <BR> <BR>Not that i believe that that is at all likely, I&#39;m just sayin that would be WILD!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
