<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1600"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Enzoryon<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Enzoryon<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, December 05, 2004 - 12:00 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I read the post that states butters used to live in Cali.  I read somewhere that one of the BTK notes/letters/packages was post marked in Cali.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
